       "text": "I haven't entered this order. As written, it's well above the maximum safe acetaminophen dose.\n\n- **Single dose:** 2000 mg is double the usual maximum of 1000 mg per dose.\n- **Daily total:** 2000 mg three times daily is 6000 mg/day. The adult maximum is 4000 mg/day, and many institutions cap it at 3000 mg/day. This dose risks serious hepatotoxicity, even with normal liver function.\n\nHere are some options that fit the patient (70 kg, normal renal and hepatic function):\n\n1. Acetaminophen 1000 mg PO three times daily (3000 mg/day).\n2. Acetaminophen 1000 mg PO four times daily (4000 mg/day, the maximum).\n3. Acetaminophen 650 mg PO every 6 hours (2600 mg/day).\n\nIf 2000 mg three times daily was intentional, please confirm that. If it was a typo, tell me which option you want, or give me a different regimen, and I'll enter it right away."
